    "page_title": "Events endpoint",
    "short_description": "Query and replay events that have flowed through a pipeline via the v3 REST API.",
    "body": "<h1>Events endpoint {{ds:component/chip|label=v3|variant=primary}} {{ds:component/chip|label=Stable|variant=success}}</h1>
<p>Query and replay <a href="{{cms:item/6277e4fb-3e99-45b0-a7f6-aefe69c5778f}}">events</a> that have flowed through a pipeline. Base URL: <code>https://api.godzilladocs.dev/v3</code>.</p>

<p><strong>New in v3:</strong> Enhanced filtering by event attributes, batch operations, and improved replay capabilities.</p>

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=v2 withdrawn|body_html=<p>v2 is no longer supported and will not accept new requests. All integrations must migrate to v3. See the <a href="{{cms:item/df684bef-1cbc-46ab-8ac2-64d7ac2b0f75}}">migration guide</a> for upgrade instructions.</p>}}

<h2 id="list">List events</h2>
<p><code>GET /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events</code> — cursor-paginated with enhanced filtering by event attributes.</p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter to a single event type, e.g. <code>order.created</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>since</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>ISO-8601 timestamp lower bound on <code>occurred_at</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><code>until</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>ISO-8601 timestamp upper bound on <code>occurred_at</code> (new in v3).</td></tr><tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Filter by event status: <code>pending</code>, <code>delivered</code>, <code>failed</code>, or <code>dead-lettered</code> (new in v3).</td></tr><tr><td><code>cursor</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Opaque pagination cursor from a previous response's <code>next_cursor</code>.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/code-block|filename=event.json|language=json|code=&#123;
  "id": "evt_8f2c1a90",
  "type": "order.created",
  "occurred_at": "2026-08-18T09:12:44Z",
  "status": "delivered",
  "payload": &#123; "order_id": "ord_4471" &#125;
&#125;}}

<h2 id="replay">Replay a dead-lettered event</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/events/{id}/replay</code> — re-runs an event that exhausted its retries from where it was dead-lettered. See the <a href="{{cms:item/6cb11c67-ca08-4c36-8e37-1bb61973f94e}}">Error handling & recovery</a> guide for when to use this versus reprocessing an entire time range.</p>

<h2 id="batch-replay">Batch replay</h2>
<p><code>POST /v3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/events/replay-batch</code> — replay multiple dead-lettered events matching a filter (new in v3).</p>

{{ds:component/parameter-table|rows_html=<tr><td><code>type</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Replay only events of this type.</td></tr><tr><td><code>since</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Replay events from this ISO-8601 timestamp onward.</td></tr><tr><td><code>until</code></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td>Replay events up to this ISO-8601 timestamp.</td></tr>}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=info|title=Platform events|body_html=<p>Lifecycle notifications like <code>pipeline.started</code> and <code>connector.error</code> are not returned by this endpoint — subscribe to them through the Webhooks endpoint instead.</p>}}

